  "body": "Found during the theme audit for #2039 (`upstream/main` `31f8d03d7`). Companion to #2021 (open PR #2027) and #2025 (open PR #2038).\n\nWhat is fixed today:\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/shell.rs:46,119`: `const STATUS_H: f32 = 22.0;` hardcodes the bottom status strip height instead of reading a theme token (or deriving from `control_height`/`font_row`). Increasing font or control sizes in a theme does not grow the status bar.\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/panes.rs:1077,1084,1099-1102,1122`: `ribbon_tabs` still hardcodes tab strip left inset (`8.0` at `:1077`), horizontal tab padding (`+ 24.0` at `:1084`), active underline inset (`6.0` at `:1099-1100`), underline thickness (`Stroke::new(2.0, pal.accent)` at `:1102`), and inter-tab gap (`+ 2.0` at `:1122`) beside #2021's `ribbon_tab_h`.\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/theme.rs:307`: `s.spacing.window_margin = Margin::same(self.item_spacing_y.max(6.0) as i8);` couples `window_margin` to `item_spacing_y` with a hardcoded floor of `6.0` instead of an explicit `window_margin` token (and `theme.rs:328-329` uses literal `24` for window/menu radius caps).\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/file_drop.rs:71-72`: drop-target overlay frame hardcodes inset/corner radius `6.0`, stroke `2.0`, and hint font `22.0` instead of theme tokens/scaling (`file_drop.rs` colour literals belong to #1120).\n\nDone means:\n- `Tokens` exposes theme keys for status bar height, ribbon tab horizontal padding/gap/indicator thickness (or derives them consistently from named ribbon-tab keys), and `window_margin`, with sane `clamp` bounds.\n- Consumers in `shell.rs`, `panes.rs`, `theme.rs`, and `file_drop.rs` read the theme instead of those literals.\n- Once #2038 merges, `assets/themes/theme.json.example` includes every new key and its key-set test passes; contrast/loading/layout tests cover the new tokens without changing default dark/light visuals.\n",
